# Line endings: LF in the repository, native in the working tree.
#
# `core.autocrlf` is a per-clone setting and did not hold. Two merged
# pull requests - #64 and #69 - each rewrote every line of bot.py
# because a tool wrote it with CRLF and the commit kept them, so the
# real change (about seventy lines each time) was buried in a diff of
# four and a half thousand. This file is in the repository, so it
# applies to every clone and cannot be forgotten.
* text=auto

# Content, not text. Without these, `text=auto` guesses from the bytes
# and a guess that goes wrong corrupts the file.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.xlsx binary
